sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Host / Adapter
  participant O as Shadow observer
  participant R as Scoped read view
  participant S as Offline analyzer
  participant V as Deterministic validator
  participant H as Trusted review Host
  A->>O: Authoritative event + cursor + scope
  O->>R: Read authorized snapshot / revisions
  alt Proved metadata-only
    O->>O: Record skip reason, sample for audit
  else Relevant event
    O->>S: Bounded packet with scoped handles
    S-->>O: Layered draft, clarification or abstention
    O->>V: Validate packet and response
    V->>R: Re-check epoch / revision / evidence
    alt Stale, unauthorized or invalid
      V-->>O: Reject and record; no write
    else Valid
      V-->>O: Shadow receipt; no write
      opt Separately approved Host review path
        O-->>H: Draft only
        H->>H: Explicit confirm + transactional CAS / reject
      end
    end
  end
